{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "c0d90b6460347da03f9f13d5ec26c77edb85df9b719cfbe33e3d52a4fd0fbec1", "ja": "小さな陰り", "zh": "小小的阴影", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "18b3f3137412efae59aeabfba663c5d606d7888b4afbf55bbc87f44e36cd1112", "ja": "イベントの仕事に臨んだ莉緒とエレナ。午前\nの部が終わったところで、莉緒は若いファン\nに逃げられたと落ち込んでいた。そんな中\n午後の部で機材トラブルが発生し、プロデュ\nーサーは二人を残して様子を見に行くが…。", "zh": "莉绪与艾琳娜为了工作出席活动，在上午的\n场次结束之后，莉绪因为年轻粉丝在她面前\n逃跑而感到沮丧。此时，下午的场次发生了\n设备故障的意外，因此制作人将两人留下，\n前去查看状况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5eb2434122536dc3f077c907bd0f23459ba5a7ed3d365470d081bf96b611eb53", "ja": "（今日はエレナと莉緒で、イベントの仕事だ。\nARRIVEの宣伝をするいい機会だ！）", "zh": "（今天艾琳娜和莉绪要参加活动，\n这是宣传『ARRIVE』的大好机会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b7d5c8c9d1a50a96cf003f57dcc225ac1a8b32ab632ec95b2edf77bb16ac8889", "ja": "エレナ、莉緒。ふたりとも準備はいいか？\nARRIVEの宣伝、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "艾琳娜、莉绪，你们准备好了吗？\n就拜托你们宣传『ARRIVE』了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "945b9fe974a575e26b85f38e2aa49aa7aa0be1d38160cf8b386208c31def727d", "ja": "もちろん！　お肌のコンディションも、バッチリ\n整えてきたし……レッスンの成果、見せるわよ♪", "zh": "当然！肤况也调整得非常完美……\n让大家看看训练的成果吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "c87b755c2df3219073479b0e560d11e34f6d26e86e76a32a24ca9e32c56b6fe8", "ja": "いっぱいのお客さんに囲まれて、レッツダンシング！\nエヘヘ。想像するだけでワクワクするネっ！", "zh": "被满场观众包围，Let's dancing！\n嘿嘿，光想像就兴奋又期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e0f9c083a3e11317702bde6dcb80f059d369552f827e228655ad7563f71a2470", "ja": "気合い充分だな！　でも今日は、午前と午後の\n二部構成だ。張り切りすぎて、バテないようにな？", "zh": "真有干劲呢！但今天有上午和下午两个场次，\n可别因为上半场拚过头而昏头了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "04623e86785feb45515a7689c6be1e87d2f86aed91a83bd0bd0eeb95c49f57fa", "ja": "えー、{$P$}は心配しすぎだヨー。\nダンスだったら何時間でも続けられるヨ。ねっ、リオ？", "zh": "咦～{$P$}你操心过头了啦～\n要我们跳几个小时的舞都没问题喔，对不对，莉绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "36717b27f17bed79cd7b5a6ad4a44791202911e998f2775de3aaa8c59f7beece", "ja": "ええ、楽勝よ！\n私達の晴れ舞台、しっかり見ててちょうだい。", "zh": "是呀，轻轻松松！\n你就好好看着我们的重要演出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "b3d0127cb6f2756ebc820a7e2b2da24898fb0158077434b31dfc6a69dbe69dd6", "ja": "それじゃ、行ってくるネ！", "zh": "那我们就上场啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "45a43c8d30a85b26bbf74bdd7d0867eff14fe26744edf8b0df5dbb6683295763", "ja": "ああ！　頑張ってこい……！", "zh": "好！加油表演吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1009_null", "source_sha256": "55d5237f65b15681f3ffa407984d6426a2f0e98ba3654110bcd74b72a4152e34", "ja": "午前のステージ　終了……", "zh": "上午的表演结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "35bad213f5ed03f3a14d6651451a128c984ab450c93527879a6eb359180d06d1", "ja": "お疲れさま！　ふたりとも、バッチリだったぞ！", "zh": "辛苦了！两位的表现都很完美喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd4f4168f66c4597a33ad091bb463bc216eae2730f09e3c061d3bde040285df5", "ja": "でしょでしょ！　{$P$}、\nワタシのこと、もーっとほめてもいいんだヨっ。", "zh": "对吧对吧！{$P$}，\n你可以再多称赞我一点喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "528a53d05f3590418ae28f7fa48825b19e3bade6dcaeab015d1534036e0db19a", "ja": "午後のステージを無事にこなしたらな。……それで\n二人とも、お昼はどうする？　弁当があるらしいけど。", "zh": "首先要顺利完成下午的表演啊……所以，\n你们中午打算吃什么？似乎是有提供便当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "66c7030b6c873198c14efcc0d75b61044aa1e9856e107910807fe26d297b8697", "ja": "食べる～！　エヘヘ、張り切ったらお腹すいちゃった♪\nお弁当もらってくるネっ！", "zh": "我要吃～！嘿嘿，努力之后肚子就饿了♪\n我去拿便当喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8e45a2365f4a923db5d3c0f903d03f8ccb0133c5a37ced540561ea2c97ab4342", "ja": "……行ってしまった。ステージを\nこなしてきたばかりなのに、エレナは元気だな。", "zh": "……跑掉了。明明才刚表演完而已，\n艾琳娜还真有活力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "2af81f578f6554eef0813b0490975f8915e42ea5e315e4a525ef408726954591", "ja": "……………………はぁ。", "zh": "……………………唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "546d93b5a9e24190760dee237d17ab437b05282fb308fdf6679492b787286176", "ja": "莉緒は……だいぶ疲れてるみたいだな。\n水は飲めるか？", "zh": "莉绪呢……你看起来挺累的，\n喝得下水吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "382b1162da07006f5a564c0fdc1dbb6531f1ce5bb2474918b97170da4e9d5d79", "ja": "ありがとう……助かるわ。\nでもね、疲れてるだけじゃないの……。", "zh": "谢谢……得救了。\n但是呀，我并不是单纯觉得累……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "655e6dce5de2974b3ec4c9ed0ca6f236a19d05a1f038246a64b6f0a0f8659d4e", "ja": "何かあったのか？", "zh": "发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "e469338c9ca799d638705c451db9b24d8820cec4af250a5b864b7c4268bb940f", "ja": "最前列にね、若い男の子のお客さんがいたのよ。\n中学生か、高校生くらいかしら？", "zh": "刚刚在最前排，有个观众是年轻男生，\n大概国中生或高中生吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ad068803fe07d0dde3d018ee43c01d05b78cfe3bda127d0a558c45b83a2f7458", "ja": "へえ、いいことじゃないか。765プロライブ劇場が\n若い年代にも認知され始めたってことだし……。", "zh": "哦，这不是很好吗？代表年轻一代也\n开始认识765艺能演唱会剧场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "c5e7bcf12f56768314c37268759fe7f6df06c42f9549e7a1645cce46c5310ce6", "ja": "ええ！　もちろん、それ自体はいいのよ。\nただ……ただね……。", "zh": "是呀！这当然是件好事，\n但是……但是呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "6f09c88fd1ae0d652120cd4bb72df917bd2c107936c1438a28f9a9171947309b", "ja": "その男の子……私が笑顔で手を振ったら、\nバッと顔を背けて、一目散に逃げ出しちゃったの！", "zh": "那个男孩子……我只是笑着对他挥手，\n他马上就别过头，一溜烟地逃走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1e7a77a78914ca869f129533e418a7092c448ae3ac7526dcaad1c11f516936a0", "ja": "それは……単に照れてただけなんじゃないか？", "zh": "他应该……只是害羞吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "26937afc3d8cd1fe73954be0cdd3cafe6961daf11bd869d80310a48ccdd20b0c", "ja": "でも、エレナちゃんには手を振り返してたのよ！？\nなんで私だけ！？　うう、ショックだわ……！", "zh": "但是艾琳娜挥手时他有回应喔！？\n为什么只有我！？呜呜，打击好大……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ca073d023948fabd9944f045fccb3ef2b6c0e239f00a45541f4b62f02665326e", "ja": "うーん……もしかしたら、莉緒の笑顔は、\n若い男子には刺激が強すぎたのかもな……。", "zh": "唔……说不定是因为莉绪的笑容\n对年轻男生来说太过刺激了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "6f41df164d7f6ab8d17118e451c99d0abdd6289757106095da1ca53fc8cebda7", "ja": "はぁ～あ……私、もしかして年なのかしら……。\nファンには逃げられるし、体力も足りないし……。", "zh": "唉……我是不是上了年纪呢……\n粉丝看到我都逃跑了，体力也不够好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "dc0ba7474fb05a2bb190bed98db4997512766568cf1353fd058f2f70495a6c45", "ja": "エレナちゃんみたいにフレッシュな子と組むなら、\n若くて、元気ハツラツな子の方がよかったのかも……？", "zh": "如果要和像艾琳娜一样清新的女孩一起表演，\n也许要选年轻又活力四射的偶像比较好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5d4dba7cca74ea6f7b24d8a4ad4413197f707e1ee02d2677c63945c498117209", "ja": "何を弱気なことを言ってるんだ。\n各種コンディションはバッチリじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "你在说什么丧气话？\n不是说各方面的状态都很完美吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "6388620f1ffc71a76289690e129163598d561b6c3601727747064c3a02c6fd0e", "ja": "そう……そうよね。\nごめんね、変なコト言っちゃったわ。", "zh": "就是……就是说呢。\n抱歉，我说了奇怪的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "6109584c8efe7bc4cd64a755f5360a7e105be44b47e51acc71e24f9f9d81087d", "ja": "私も、お昼ごはん食べてこなくちゃ！\nじゃあ、後でね、{$P$}くん。", "zh": "我也得去吃午餐了！\n那待会见啰，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0495cf5758177c1dc476f768cd67b5749905c9e88b33549eb1fc200682d613ea", "ja": "ああ。\n午後のステージが始まるまで、しっかり休むんだぞ！", "zh": "待会见。\n要趁下午的表演开始前好好休息喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1032_null", "source_sha256": "5dfa484cd64674d268ed8f36257070f18bb5c255be27f79990897492e7acb03b", "ja": "午後……", "zh": "下午……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "0f0b06199bee176ac2ff18d563598074f9006960dad00ea54eb0c5ea5e975359", "ja": "みんな、イイ感じに盛り上がってるわね！\n次の曲は、お姉さんがもっとサービスしてア・ゲ・ル♪", "zh": "大家都好好嗨起来了呢！\n下一首歌大姊姊会给你们更多福、利、哟♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d66dd9cd4b4b1d780049364d6792909df46a6d48dd0dceae6cf64dd2fd1f0df6", "ja": "（莉緒らしいユニークなMCだ。休憩のときは\n心配したけど、この調子なら大丈夫そうだな……）", "zh": "（莉绪的主持独树一格，很有个人特色。虽然休息时\n有点担心她，但看这状况应该是没问题了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "d4fc16c8379a3082cc77845942344543d6486873a5a8a32e603df1f77bd64e2f", "ja": "それじゃ、…………？", "zh": "那么…………？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "1fa9ae02183f128150a2990a329ec78649f1f45becfa238330faaa09f8627c4a", "ja": "（ん？　莉緒の声が聞こえない……？）", "zh": "（嗯？听不到莉绪的声音……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "2cc95c761ead3da2de8aaa2f103c0305139e3c2a564a8cb9d9ab449ea8ee200a", "ja": "（莉緒がこっちを見た！\nまさか……機材トラブルか！？）", "zh": "（莉绪在看这边！\n该不会……器材故障了吧！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "898d33efcf197d1938da39aeca4e827c84886508c55ecea7fa718d6297f75e06", "ja": "ど、どうしよう、リオ！？\nマイクが全然入ってない……これじゃ歌えないヨー！", "zh": "怎、怎么办呀，莉绪！？\n麦克风完全没声音……这样没办法唱歌啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "48c5cc4bd90c61ded7018ce514266f0f3d4a1e3055029e5c6b78ec9c75d4e7e9", "ja": "大丈夫よ、エレナちゃん。……みんなー！\n音声が止まっちゃったみたいだけど、気にしないで！", "zh": "艾琳娜，没事的……各位──！\n声音似乎出不来了，不过别在意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "802e60be2252b3468784b91d906c66e17214c85fdcf24eaa31bc4a3578d094e1", "ja": "すぐにスタッフさん達が対応してくれるから、\nそのままもうすこし待っててね！", "zh": "工作人员会立刻处理的，\n大家在原地稍等一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1042_okyaku", "source_sha256": "8dae35809899c2da0496222658e8a6a1f0d8d5aa1fcbee649be781fcae622f20", "ja": "いいよー！", "zh": "好喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1043_okyaku", "source_sha256": "7a7df930e02ded32f1e7746c05793d9feee4c42825d497c0eff31b69122ca172", "ja": "待ってるー！", "zh": "等你们──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1044_046rio", "source_sha256": "e9b66e01920126258589f4baef3ea5804d8efafa2e206da54ae0b1b4773ea390", "ja": "ウフッ、ありがと♪\nみんな、大好きよー！　チュッ！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢♪\n我最爱大家了──！啾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "88bf8329d42671c770987c20a9f19992df1d3003c5aa4ab32cc9754ea4936e80", "ja": "……ふう。\nとりあえずは、こんなところで大丈夫かしら？", "zh": "……呼。\n总之先这样处理，应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "175f32887caae5c741f06a341f35182f127d3b1885901980ea61f4680354095a", "ja": "ナイスフォローだ、莉緒！　少し待機しててくれ。\n俺は原因を調べてくる！", "zh": "莉绪，处理得好！你们稍等一下，\n我去调查原因！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "b7852d986740f7cd25c41c066a1bddb4d0696b3811070385dc9de5d155d2f1aa", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}、行っちゃうノ？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，你要离开吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "f5f7970980f68099b65fcd3adf0ef9a344eba367236b80052f45d24ed01f6056", "ja": "大丈夫だ、すぐ戻ってくるから。\nふたりは指示があるまで、控え室で待っててくれ！", "zh": "没事的，我马上就会回来。\n在收到指示之前，你们先在准备室等着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "9485f9fe0802a91e37bbe13c1d4db82a330bd19dba0d883a7554fa76cb0f99bd", "ja": "リオ……。\n{$P$}、行っちゃったネ……。", "zh": "莉绪……\n{$P$}走掉了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1050_046rio", "source_sha256": "ea03b9bb9236cbe165ca5ffd2116964159be2bacc3d724d6687ad62a2ebf4d7d", "ja": "大丈夫よ、エレナちゃん。\n{$P$}くんなら、すぐ戻ってくるわ。", "zh": "不会有事的，艾琳娜。\n{$P$}他很快就会回来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1051_018ele", "source_sha256": "2081f019cd134796563cd2a28af5b152662fc595876c18ae9117512603c59624", "ja": "でも、お客さん、帰っちゃわないカナ？\nせっかく楽しいライブだったのに……。", "zh": "但是观众会不会走掉呀？\n难得演唱会的气氛那么开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1052_046rio", "source_sha256": "dfaad3390a711a3a62323407bb3b8432c778c6d434f4bd67e88b5cd1d20e6282", "ja": "うん……でも、きっと待っててくれるわ。\n私達はみんなを信じて待ちましょう。……ねっ？", "zh": "嗯……但大家一定会等我们的，\n我们就相信大家，先等等吧……好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1053_018ele", "source_sha256": "7c41014802c26cba69f71e2efe01ffba09a7bcc68a56e94599c90ae8b4c88c7a", "ja": "うん……そうだネ。\nわかった。信じて待つコトにするヨ。", "zh": "嗯……说得也对。\n我知道了，我会相信大家，先等一下的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_03_1055_kuroi", "source_sha256": "bddd9594faa95c7b3f62fb7591df16931615fe949cfd67d8432959c796371bd2", "ja": "ククク……百瀬莉緒、か。\nなるほど、なかなか……悪くないではないか。", "zh": "哼哼哼……百濑莉绪吗？\n原来如此……这不是挺不错的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
